8:| ADR-004 | Accepted | Fix HEV's internal UDP mode to UDP-in-TCP and reuse its datagram address framing |
9:| ADR-005 | Accepted | Use SSH `direct-tcpip` for TCP and a rootless exec/stdio relay for UDP |
10:| ADR-006 | Accepted | Upload the relay through exec stdin; do not add SFTP to `SSHTransport` |
